OL,3,ALib Dem leader Davey about to give
OL,4,Aspeech on final day of party conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat leader Ed Davey is
OL,7,Fabout to deliver a speech at his
OL,8,Fparty's autumn conference in Brighton -
OL,9,Fwatch live above
OL,11,FHe's expected to set out policies and
OL,12,Fspeak about the global development of
OL,13,FAI, and its "existential threat"
OL,15,FIn the run-up to his address, Davey
OL,16,Fsays there is no ceiling on Lib Dem
OL,17,Fambitions and that he's a "candidate to
OL,18,Fbe prime minister"
